      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "L'Aube Dorée offers an intimate dining atmosphere, wrapped in dim, sophisticated lighting that sets a high standard for your evening. The star of the meal was the slow-cooked duck breast, whose tender meat paired exquisitely with a vibrant blackberry reduction and perfectly crispy skin. While the escargots possessed a wonderful freshness, the lemon tart delivered a wonderfully bright, texturally superb close to a memorable culinary experience. Service was attentive, though pacing between the courses could see a slight refinement.",
      "source": "target",
